    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "The Property Shop are delighted to present to the market No. 70 Summerseat Court, a well-presented end of terrace residence with private parking, offering bright and spacious accommodation throughout. Measuring approx. 102m2 / 1,098 Sq. Ft. the property features three bedrooms, two bathrooms, kitchen/dining, a generous sitting room with large windows that flood the interior with an abundance of natural light and a sunny rear balcony overlooking well maintained landscaped communal gardens. creating a warm and inviting living space.\n\nNestled just off the Main Street in the sought-after Summerseat development, the property is only a stones throw of local shops, schools, cafés, and a range of amenities. Excellent public transport links include the No. 70 and 270 bus routes, while Dunboyne Train Station and Blanchardstown Shopping Centre are just a short drive away. The property offers excellent access to the M50, providing convenient connectivity to Dublin City Centre and beyond.\n\nViewing is highly recommended and is by appointment only through The Property Shop on 01 825 5222."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "ENTRANCE HALL\nEnter through hardwood door with glass panels to hall with guest wc with additional storage.\n\nLIVING ROOM - 4.69m (15'5\") x 4.65m (15'3\") : 21.81 sqm (235 sqft)\nBright and spacious with feature fireplace with gas fire, access to private balcony, laminate flooring and double doors leading to.....\n\nKITCHEN/DINING - 5.78m (19'0\") x 2.66m (8'9\") : 15.37 sqm (165 sqft)\nDual aspect with a range of eye and floor level units, tiled splashback, gas hob, bay window and laminate flooring. Also plumbed for laundry machines.\n\nBEDROOM - 3.11m (10'2\") x 3.96m (13'0\") : 12.32 sqm (133 sqft)\nPrimary bedroom with en suite, built in wardrobes and laminate flooring.\n\nEN SUITE\nwith wc, whb and shower cubicle with Triton electric shower.\n\nBEDROOM - 3.96m (13'0\") x 2.34m (7'8\") : 9.27 sqm (100 sqft)\nDual aspect double room situated to the front of the property with built in wardrobes and laminate flooring.\n\nBEDROOM - 2.94m (9'8\") x 1.97m (6'6\") : 5.79 sqm (62 sqft)\nCurrently in use as a home office with built in slide robe and laminate flooring.\n\nBATHROOM - 2.36m (7'9\") x 1.41m (4'8\") : 3.33 sqm (36 sqft)\nMain bathroom with wc, whb, bath with tile surround and window for natural light and ventilation.\n\nBALCONY\nSpacious, south facing private balcony overlooking landscaped communal gardens.\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Sunny south facing private balcony </li><li> Excellent end of terrace property flooded with natural light </li><li> Ideally located in the heart of Clonee Village </li><li> Beautifully maintained landscaped communal gardens </li><li> Gas fired central heating </li><li> Ample parking</li></ul>"
      },
